# Code Review Graph Context

**Canonical procedure:** `skills/code-review-graph/SKILL.md` (SSOT — workflow, MCP setup, maintenance).

**When:** repository-scoped work (reviews, impact, refactors, cross-module debug, mapping) — graph **before** broad file reads.

**Skip:** tiny tasks where the target file or symbol is already known.

**Setup (summary):** MCP in `~/.gemini/antigravity/mcp_config.json`; register repos; per-repo `build`. Full commands and agent behavior → skill.
